---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import yardRitualImg from "../../assets/images/yard-ritual.webp";
import GlossaryTerm from "../ui/GlossaryTerm.astro";
---

<section
  id="living-tradition-hero"
  class="relative w-full min-h-[85vh] lg:min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-center overflow-hidden bg-maroon-dark text-white pt-[calc(var(--header-h)+2rem)] pb-12 sm:pb-16"
  aria-label="Living Tradition Hero Banner"
>
  <!-- Full-Bleed Ultra-HD Background Photograph -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none">
    <Image
      src={yardRitualImg}
      alt="Resident monastic sangha gathered in the courtyard of Main Jonang Takten Phuntsok Choeling, Sanjauli, Shimla"
      widths={[640, 1024, 1600, 2048]}
      sizes="100vw"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover object-[center_35%] transform scale-100 will-change-transform"
      loading="eager"
      fetchpriority="high"
      decoding="async"
    />
    <!-- Asymmetric left-feathered scrim: softens ONLY the text column on the left, keeping the center and right 100% bright & sunlit -->
    <div
      class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-full sm:w-3/4 lg:w-3/5 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/80 via-black/40 to-transparent pointer-events-none"
    >
    </div>
    <div
      class="absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 h-24 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent pointer-events-none"
    >
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Main Hero Content: Asymmetric Left-Anchored Editorial Layout -->
  <div
    class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 my-auto flex flex-col items-start text-left"
  >
    <div class="max-w-xl lg:max-w-2xl flex flex-col gap-4 sm:gap-5">
      <!-- Consecrated Tibetan Calligraphy Headline -->
      <div
        lang="bo"
        class="font-tibetan text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-gold font-bold pt-1 leading-[1.6] whitespace-normal sm:whitespace-nowrap drop-shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]"
      >
        ༄༅། །ཇོ་ནང་དགོན་པའི་ཉིན་རེའི་འཚོ་བ་དང་སྲོལ་རྒྱུན། །
      </div>

      <!-- Monumental Display Title -->
      <h1
        class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-normal text-white tracking-tight leading-[1.08] drop-shadow-[0_4px_16px_rgba(0,0,0,0.95)] m-0"
      >
        The Living Tradition of Jonang
      </h1>

      <!-- Evocative Narrative Lede -->
      <p
        class="font-serif text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-xl text-white/95 max-w-xl leading-relaxed drop-shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)] m-0"
      >
        Situated on the cedar ridges of Shimla, Main Jonang Takten Phuntsok Choeling maintains
        the unbroken rhythm of monastic life—from dawn <GlossaryTerm id="gandi" class="text-white hover:text-gold border-gold/60">gandi slit-gongs</GlossaryTerm> and prayer assemblies to
        rigorous <GlossaryTerm id="chos-rwa" class="text-white hover:text-gold border-gold/60">courtyard debate</GlossaryTerm>, sacred arts, and environmental stewardship.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
